WEBVTT

00:00:09.432 --> 00:00:12.977
I've lived among them
for 20 years, Hiccup,

00:00:13.144 --> 00:00:15.021
discovering their secrets.

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:18.483
[laughs]

00:00:18.608 --> 00:00:20.610
-He likes you.
-Wow.

00:00:21.527 --> 00:00:22.904
You must be hungry.

00:00:22.987 --> 00:00:24.530
Uh. Yeah, I could eat.

00:00:24.614 --> 00:00:27.283
Good. It's feeding time.

00:00:36.459 --> 00:00:37.961
I don't like it.

00:00:38.044 --> 00:00:40.004
They should have
been back with Hiccup by now.

00:00:40.088 --> 00:00:42.423
I don't like it either. Eret, son of Eret

00:00:42.507 --> 00:00:45.134
was the man of my dreams. My everything!

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.637
But, baby, I grew facial hair for you.

00:00:48.054 --> 00:00:49.305
Me, too.

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:51.224
What if Drago shot them down?

00:00:51.391 --> 00:00:53.601
What if they need our help?

00:00:54.143 --> 00:00:55.645
We have to find them.

00:00:55.812 --> 00:00:57.146
Wait, what? No, but Stoick said…

00:00:57.313 --> 00:00:59.107
It doesn't matter what he said,

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:00.441
if they have all been captured.

00:01:00.525 --> 00:01:01.442
Come on!

00:01:05.321 --> 00:01:06.531
[trapper] Do we go back?

00:01:06.656 --> 00:01:09.826
[Eret] We have
nowhere to go, nothing to sell,

00:01:09.909 --> 00:01:11.661
and no heads to call our own!

00:01:11.786 --> 00:01:15.248
If we don't turn
up with dragons, and fast… [screams]

00:01:16.708 --> 00:01:18.584
Careful what you wish for!

00:01:19.544 --> 00:01:21.004
Eret, son of Eret!

00:01:21.546 --> 00:01:23.423
-What is this?
-A kidnapping.

00:01:23.589 --> 00:01:26.467
Yay! Can he ride with me?
Can he? [huskily] Can he?

00:01:26.551 --> 00:01:27.760
[Eret] Ugh!

00:01:27.844 --> 00:01:29.679
You're gonna show us the way to Drago.

00:01:29.846 --> 00:01:34.017
And help dragon riders
sneak into Drago's camp? Just kill me now.

00:01:34.142 --> 00:01:36.769
That could be arranged. Stormfly, drop it!

00:01:36.853 --> 00:01:38.438
Huh? [screams]

00:01:39.314 --> 00:01:40.732
Good girl!

00:01:41.316 --> 00:01:42.734
Stormfly, fetch!

00:01:43.943 --> 00:01:45.737
[Eret screaming] All right!

00:01:45.903 --> 00:01:48.781
Okay! I'll take you to Drago!

00:01:51.492 --> 00:01:52.535
Works every time.

00:01:52.618 --> 00:01:53.619
[Eret panting]

00:01:56.622 --> 00:01:57.665
[dragons screeching]

00:02:00.877 --> 00:02:02.962
Hey, I thought we were going to eat.

00:02:03.379 --> 00:02:04.714
Oh, we are.

00:02:13.806 --> 00:02:15.224
[bellowing]

00:02:20.563 --> 00:02:21.689
[gasps]

00:02:21.773 --> 00:02:23.566
[laughing]

00:02:36.287 --> 00:02:39.082
Then, from Dragon Island,
I found this archipelago…

00:02:46.339 --> 00:02:47.799
[Valka] There.

00:02:48.299 --> 00:02:50.593
[sighs] Whoa!

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:52.595
[Toothless groans]

00:02:58.518 --> 00:02:59.936
[chuckles]

00:03:07.193 --> 00:03:08.236
Whoo-hoo!

00:03:08.319 --> 00:03:09.320
[laughing]

00:03:40.226 --> 00:03:41.978
[Valka] Oh, when I'm up here

00:03:42.145 --> 00:03:45.398
I don't even feel the cold. I just feel…

00:03:45.815 --> 00:03:47.150
Free.

00:03:50.528 --> 00:03:55.366
[inhales] This is what it
is to be a dragon, Hiccup.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:58.786
It's all well and good
to call yourself a dragon,

00:03:58.995 --> 00:04:00.496
but can you fly?

00:04:01.414 --> 00:04:02.498
[gasps]

00:04:10.882 --> 00:04:11.924
[laughs]

00:04:12.008 --> 00:04:13.050
[whooping]

00:04:21.684 --> 00:04:22.852
Oh, no!

00:04:30.902 --> 00:04:32.570
Ha! [laughs]

00:04:32.778 --> 00:04:33.946
[whooping]

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:36.073
-Man! Almost!
-[sneezes]

00:04:36.199 --> 00:04:38.659
We just about had it that time!

00:04:39.493 --> 00:04:40.536
[grunts]

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:41.621
[spits]

00:04:43.122 --> 00:04:44.582
Incredible.

00:04:45.208 --> 00:04:47.543
Well, not bad yourself.

00:04:57.386 --> 00:05:00.389
All this time, you took after me.

00:05:01.307 --> 00:05:04.227
And where was I?

00:05:06.229 --> 00:05:08.564
I'm so sorry, Hiccup.

00:05:08.731 --> 00:05:11.400
Can we start over?

00:05:15.112 --> 00:05:16.739
Will you give me another chance?

00:05:20.618 --> 00:05:24.622
I can teach you all
that I have learned these past 20 years.

00:05:24.789 --> 00:05:26.457
-Like…
-[moans]

00:05:30.962 --> 00:05:32.004
Wow.

00:05:32.088 --> 00:05:34.590
Now you can make those tight turns.

00:05:37.426 --> 00:05:39.262
Did you know about this?

00:05:40.263 --> 00:05:42.556
Every dragon has its secrets.

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:45.935
And I'll show them all to you.

00:05:46.102 --> 00:05:47.645
We'll unlock every mystery,

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:50.523
find every last species together,

00:05:50.606 --> 00:05:52.149
as mother and son.

00:05:52.984 --> 00:05:54.443
[laughing]

00:05:55.569 --> 00:05:56.779
[laughing]

00:05:57.613 --> 00:06:01.826
This gift we share, Hiccup, it bonds us.

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:05.871
This is who you are, son.

00:06:06.038 --> 00:06:07.623
Who we are.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:11.460
We will change the world for all dragons.

00:06:11.627 --> 00:06:14.297
We will make it a better, safer place.

00:06:14.505 --> 00:06:16.132
Yeah. I mean…

00:06:16.257 --> 00:06:18.342
That sounds amazing.

00:06:21.429 --> 00:06:22.847
[sighs]

00:06:30.688 --> 00:06:32.523
This is so great!

00:06:32.648 --> 00:06:35.401
Now you and I can
go talk to Drago together.

00:06:35.568 --> 00:06:36.694
What?

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:39.155
There's no talking to Drago.

00:06:39.322 --> 00:06:40.573
-But we have to…
-No.

00:06:40.656 --> 00:06:42.366
We must protect our own.

00:06:43.492 --> 00:06:45.536
Come on, we should be getting back.

00:06:46.704 --> 00:06:47.705
Hmm?

00:06:56.505 --> 00:06:57.923
[Eret grunts]

00:07:00.593 --> 00:07:03.888
Okay! Look, I got you here.
Now get this thing off me.

00:07:04.055 --> 00:07:05.931
Never take a toy from a dragon.

00:07:06.098 --> 00:07:07.350
Don't you know anything?

00:07:07.516 --> 00:07:08.768
[Eret groans]

00:07:08.851 --> 00:07:11.395
Why does this keep happening to me?

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:19.487
[men shouting indistinctly]

00:07:25.701 --> 00:07:27.370
What's down there?

00:07:29.121 --> 00:07:32.041
Large diameter bubbles, massive lungs,

00:07:32.208 --> 00:07:34.377
cold water deep dweller.

00:07:34.502 --> 00:07:38.047
I'm thinking
class-five leviathan, maybe six.

00:07:38.297 --> 00:07:40.466
[growls]

00:07:42.093 --> 00:07:43.552
[yells]

00:07:45.471 --> 00:07:46.847
[groaning]

00:07:50.643 --> 00:07:52.144
[men shouting]

00:07:52.895 --> 00:07:54.480
[Fishlegs] Meatlug! What's wrong, girl?

00:07:54.563 --> 00:07:56.440
[men shouting indistinctly]

